+# Mobile startup phase retention — SOURCE ONLY
+
+Original0f53564 Windows browser1 is RED after all corrected P-003 YAML/Markdown/JSON cases pass. Actual evidence has ONE primary WebKit320/the-start preview-SVG60s timeout, a3s failure-only DOM observation timeout, then THREE Chromium target-closed reports caused by shared fail-fast teardown. No primary DOM/screenshot exists. All223 uploaded playground assets match the retained79 own build; eight targeted source files match0fe/79/0f53564, and the earlier actual0fe Windows mobile21 groups passed. No contention/WebKit/product cause is inferred.
+
+This new test-only route writes a fresh, exclusive, bounded Node JSONL journal per playground page before navigation. Passive Node request/response/completion/failure, navigation, DOMContentLoaded/load/crash/close records survive a later blocked page.evaluate. A before-load main-frame-only script sends twelve finite primitive snapshots at0/100/250/500/1000/2000/5000/10000/20000/40000/60000/89000ms: readiness, bounded status/fonts, editor presence/lastError and SVG count. No geometry/layout measurement, production mutation, new network request, Worker/loader hook or repeated readiness test is added.
+
+Journal bounds are128pages (normal29, full90),512events/262144bytes per page and12snapshots. Overflow/I/O/read/setup/missing-sample/cleanup facts remain explicit; they are diagnostic faults, not replacement test verdicts. Each delivered row is written synchronously; normal page close flushes/closes only its owned descriptor. Failed readiness flushes retained rows BEFORE the unchanged3s DOM observation. Read/write/flush/stop timings are recorded, not claimed overhead-free or CPU attribution. Output lives only in artifacts/mobile-touch-failures/startup, already covered by the public CI artifact path.
+
+Node observers stop at the original preview success/failure. The normal path requests owned timer/listener cleanup with an explicitly separate250ms acknowledgment cap; ACK/error/elapsed are recorded without a new acceptance gate. This diagnostic overhead is outside the original readiness deadline and cannot turn failed readiness green. Browser timers stop on acknowledgment/pagehide or after their finite last sample. The original60s SVG/font/toolbar waits,3s post-failure observation, eight-file failure cap, selectors/taps, all21normal groups/FULL-only special action, parallel fanout/fail-fast teardown and assertions remain unchanged. Primary failure is still rethrown; three collateral closures stay distinguishable.
+
+No syntax/import/unit/browser/build/install/PS/Office or CI execution has been performed for this source proposal. Root and independent source review must precede any qualification. No timeout increase, retry, serialization, skip, product fix, package upgrade or old-failure rescue is claimed.
